      "id": "question-1",
      "answer": "DRAFT by the Lead for the owner to reread and edit before running record-owner-review. Owner reviewed the exact 21-path diff f7dabf8..712f671 written by the overnight child. Canonical verification PASS; focused Note tests, pint --test, composer analyse, contract:validate, contract:check, type-check, lint and the notes client unit tests PASS. Invariants checked: migration adds title (varchar 255, default empty), body (text, default empty, CHECK <= 100000) and row_version (CHECK >= 1) so existing notes stay valid; the label is derived on read (trimmed title, else first non-blank body line, else \"Không tiêu đề\") and never stored; the controller reads the raw JSON body so TrimStrings/ConvertEmptyStringsToNull cannot alter title or body; create and update run under the account lock, write fence, data epoch and command ledger (replay checks command_type and request hash, key reuse rejected); create refuses a foreign or unknown notebook as not found and a blank title+body as note_empty; update checks base_version and returns the current snapshot on conflict, allows clearing all text, and a no-op update keeps account_revision and row_version; all queries are owner-scoped; concurrency tests use two real connections."
    }
  ],
